  "decision_conditions": [
    "&lt;p&gt;The revised scheme has not overcome the previous reason(s) for refusal, in that the proposed extension would mean a loss of outlook from a first-floor rear window of no. 61 Melford Road, more specifically the bedroom which this window serves. This is harmful to living conditions of the occupiers of this habitable room and would be contrary to the amenity objectives of Policy 57 of the adopted Waltham Forest Local Plan LP1 (2024), which aims to protect outlook and avoid an increased sense of enclosure for existing occupiers.&lt;/p&gt;"
